p the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fd77e31-8049-4555-8986-4c4990e0d15f","uuid":"8eebf838-7824-4f80-9df3-84f8e1c83a28","timestamp":"2026-05-20T14:03:56.421Z","isSynthetic":true}
